Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:28.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(俄罗斯 莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.78,0:01:25.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,隧道追击的嫌疑犯正从 基辅斯基火车站向东逃离
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:37.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意负责这个计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意负责这个计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:05.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意负责这个计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:21.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有武器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把对讲机给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你无仇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:04:01.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《谍影重重3》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(六周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(中央情报局 维吉尼亚州 兰利)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能逃出如来佛的手掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no place it won't catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的故事都是这结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how every story ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:20.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的本性 杰森 是个杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what you are, Jason, a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远也无法改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续啊! 快啊! 动手 动手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Go on. Go on! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会让我这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wouldn't want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你活着的唯一理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the only reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"她"是指谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is "she"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·克鲁兹 他的女友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie Kreutz, his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:39.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在印度被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was killed in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是中情局行动主管 华德·艾伯特下的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director of Operations Ward Abbott arranged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:49.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 我们的一位无耻主管杀了他女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we have a dirty section chief who kills Bourne's girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:52.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩回来报仇 录下了艾伯特供词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne comes back for revenge, tapes Abbott's confession
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后艾伯特自杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Abbott commits suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在他来找我们算帐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Bourne's gunning for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't make this stuff up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:05.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最近发现伯恩的踪影是在莫斯科 六个星期前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's last confirmed location was Moscow, six weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在逃亡中 很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the run. He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:11.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 恕我直言 我认为可能还有其他原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sir, with respect, I think something else could be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么? 他为什么要逃亡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What's he after?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩去莫斯科是为了 找他第一个杀害目标的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reason Bourne went to Moscow was to see the daughter of his first target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是什么 帕梅?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your point, Pam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能他在回忆他的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he was retracing his steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在寻找某样东西 他回忆里的某样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's looking for something. Something in his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他还没找到 我们需要知道他在找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he hasn't found it yet and we need to know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:30.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为他对我们没有威胁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me he's not a threat to this agency?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想如果他真的想害我们 大可以把录音带寄到CNN去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if he wanted to hurt us, he could have sent the tape to CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他会这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he still will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的首要原则就是 抱着最大的希望做最坏的打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My number one rule is hope for the best, plan for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言 伯恩始终是个很大的威胁 除非你能证明我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as I'm concerned, Bourne is still a serious threat until proven otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:49.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续寻找他的踪影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:51.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是 长官 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:57.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(意大利 都灵)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是三年前的照片 那时有一半的国际刑警都在追捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's three years ago. They had half of Interpol after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:41.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来他曾出现在那不勒斯 柏林 莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned up in Naples, Berlin, Moscow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后又消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与他一起逃亡的女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl that he was on the run with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:51.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·克鲁兹 尸体在另一半地球的河里被找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie Kreutz. She was found dead in a river halfway round the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,头部中枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd been shot in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:57.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都意味着什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What connects the dots?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把录音机关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the tape recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:19.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(法国 巴黎)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,何不先坐下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是被杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道会是这个结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew this could end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从来就没有过特例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always gonna end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么死的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how did she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被枪杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我俩在印度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were together in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人的目标是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:24.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:29.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都起源于某人 我要把他找出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone started all of this and I'm gonna find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(希思路国际机场 英国 伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 他什么都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. He knows the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩只不过是冰山一角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's just the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:10:00.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听说过"黑荆棘"计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard of an Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:02.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好整理一下并写成报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get my head around this and type it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(中情局分局 英国 伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:23.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃施朗电子监测网发现关键词"黑荆棘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning. GoSat 21. I have a hit on ECHELON. Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍 是"黑荆棘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,信号似乎来自欧洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like it's coming from a European signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,国家安全局 请确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NSA, please confirm your receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到频率和坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bring up the frequency and the coordinates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,截获我们首要的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...intercept of our principal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官! - 什么情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir! - What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们截获到了在伦敦的一通电话 内容带有关键词"黑荆棘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We intercepted a call in London. Keyword, "Blackbriar."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 马上发给纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, send it to New York right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:54.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(中情局掩护机构 反恐局 纽约)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟踪到电话来源了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:03.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,登记者是一位叫 赛门·罗斯的伦敦记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Registered to a London reporter named Simon Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为《卫报》工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Works at the Guardian newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:07.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你正在跟踪他吗? - 是的 长官!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're tracking him? - Sir. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:08.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 麦克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个调查小组正在跟踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a survey team covering him at work
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外还派了一组人潜入他的公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a sneak and peek's on their way to his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟谁联系过? 他怎么会知道"黑荆棘"计划?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who talked to him? How did he find out about Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我们已经调查过他的背景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. We pulled his background
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且反复确认了所有的疑点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ran a cross-check on any known anomalies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:21.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但什么也没有发现 不过我认为只要跟踪罗斯 就能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've come up with nothing. But I think if we follow Ross, we're gonna be able...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雷 罗斯不重要 我们要的是消息来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ray, Ross is easy. We want the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听说过"黑荆棘"计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard of an Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有细节吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have details?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要好好整理一下并写成报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get my head around this and type it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:50.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这些? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that all? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:57.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备标准行动 为以防万一 让杀手待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want rendition protocols and put the asset on standby, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家听着 这是4级紧急事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People, listen up! This is a full priority situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 把罗斯的档案投到1号屏上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, give me Ross' profile on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:11.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目标是一位英国记者 赛门·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our target is a British national, Simon Ross. A reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:16.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要监视他所有的电话记录 黑莓短讯 公寓 车子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all his phones, his BlackBerry, his apartment, his car,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银行账户 信用卡账户 旅行记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bank accounts, credit cards, travel patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在他下一步行动之前 知道他的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what he's gonna think before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道他的一切秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every dirty little secret he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:26.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是 我要知道他线人的名字 以及实时位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And most of all, we want the name and real-time location of his source.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:30.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是国家安全局4级紧急事件 有什么疑问吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is NSA priority level four. Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:44.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(赛门·罗斯 国际安全事务通讯员)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(谁是杰森·伯恩? 特别报导之三)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:54.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(德国BND正与南印度警方联手调查 一位德国女性的死亡原因)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(该名女性疑为伯恩同伙 在其座驾堕桥之后淹死在河里)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意负责这个计划吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you commit to this program?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 威尔逊先生 目标正进入办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Mr. Wills, the subject is entering his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我派几个眼线到街上监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me some eyeballs on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的现场视频呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my picture, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快连上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Online now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 电话线那里怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, how you doing with the phone line?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已能监听他的办公室电话 现在正在处理手机线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we have an office line. We're working on his cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还得花多久 - 一个小时 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long? - An hour, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太慢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么知道他是不是受人指使?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how do we know he's not spinning for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有更多黑幕 他很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was more. He was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:35.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怕什么? - "黑荆棘"计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scared about what? - Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:38.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打扰一下 有你的电话 - 是谁打来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. Call for you. - Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不肯说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't give his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在我的线上 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's on my line. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赛门·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simon Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:51.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三号摄像头 大屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camera three, screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:52.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么听不到对话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't we hearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 这是座机 为什么我们监听不到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a hard line, Jimmy. Why don't we have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经监听了他的线路 但他不在那条线上 他在用别人的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have his line, sir, but he's not on it. He's using a different phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been reading your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁 - 杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is this? - This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:08.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滑铁卢车站 南站口 三十分钟后 独自过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waterloo Station. South entrance. Thirty minutes. Come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特德 尽快搞定声音信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me audio as soon as you can, Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,街道A组、B组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Street teams Alpha, Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:17.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 伙计们 行动 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, let's work it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他开始行动了 派一组眼线到街上监视 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, he is on the move. Give me eyeballs on the street. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:24.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(滑铁卢车站)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:36.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标正离开大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject exiting the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人注意 找出他的目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, everyone, let's find out where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:45.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外勤1号 我需要声音信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobile One, I need audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动声音信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Audio engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外勤1号跟上他 外勤1号跟上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobile One should have him. Mobile One should have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:51.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外勤1号跟踪他 听到内容后通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Mobile One on it. Let me know when you hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滑铁卢车站 南站口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Waterloo Station, south entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威尔逊先生 - 他要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Wills. - Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目的地是滑铁卢车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination is Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 滑铁卢车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上派眼线前往滑铁卢车站 派出所有人手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me eyes at Waterloo. Put everyone in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 命令杀手行动 - 调动外勤3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's activate the asset. - Mobilize Tracker Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 到桥上了吗? - 还没有 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we at the bridge yet? - Not yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 外勤3号 叫他们与目标保持距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Mobile Three, tell them to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:28.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请保持监视距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please maintain visual contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一台预付费手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepaid phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:58.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外勤1号 请给出目标现在的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobile One, give me the subject's current location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:05.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 目标正在前往 滑铁卢车站的南站口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the subject is arriving at the south entrance of Waterloo Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我传到5号和7号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that on five and seven as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 我需要知道电话的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, I need that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细听着我要说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to listen very carefully to what I'm about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:58.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:02.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你左手边10点钟位置 街道对面 停着一辆银色克莱斯勒旅行车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten o'clock, to your left, across the street, there's a silver Chrysler Voyager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,里面是一队监视小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a surveillance team inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正前方街道对面 12点位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Directly across the street, twelve noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个男人在二楼立柱旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a man on the second story, static post.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,监视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你左边50米距离外有个公交车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there's a bus stop 50 meters to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.19,0:18:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在就朝那个方向走去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to walk towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米 我需要电话的通话内容! 昨天就交代了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, I need that phone! I need it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在行动 他在行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the move. He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他的电话 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not his phone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他的电话 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not his phone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫不是他的电话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean that's not his phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:25.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那部电话是从哪来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell did he get another phone?
