Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:46.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 外勤2号 我要... - 快 赶快合围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mobile Two, I want... - Come on, lock the box.
