Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们两个都除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them both out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.26,0:25:06.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待在那别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得想办法突围出去 你得依我的指示行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get us out of here. You gotta do exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.14,0:25:14.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 这可不是什么报纸里瞎编的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me! This isn't some story in a newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是真的 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is real. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:19.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:31.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让所有特工撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call all agents back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:34.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉杀手伯恩的位置: 商店后边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give Bourne's location at the back of the store to the asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:35.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.61,0:25:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,支开所有监控摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.25,0:26:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伯恩 - 等一下 好像有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bourne. - Wait. Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:06.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从这里可以看到入口 如果我现在行动 应该能安全逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see the entrance from here. If I go now, I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:11.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.80,0:26:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待在那里别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.73,0:26:15.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we should wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.17,0:26:19.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在朝这个方向走来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.21,0:26:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要拼一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:07.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里出了些状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.98,0:28:13.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克雷莫局长要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director Kramer would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.45,0:28:16.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要得到许可证...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get those warrants...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说是紧急事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(什么是"黑荆棘"计划?)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.16,0:28:48.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(杰森·伯恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.22,0:29:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(西班牙 马德里)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:21.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警方已确认 被害者年龄35岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the police will tell me is that they believe the victim is 35-year-old
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.39,0:29:24.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫赛门·罗斯 是伦敦的一名著名记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simon Ross, a well-known journalist based here in London
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:26.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,供职于《卫报》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Guardian newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.69,0:29:29.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现场证据表明他是被枪杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears that he was gunned down
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.36,0:29:32.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地点为滑铁卢车站广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right in the middle of the Waterloo Station concourse
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:34.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间约为午后3时45分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around 3:45 this afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有上百位乘客目睹了事件的发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in full view of hundreds of commuters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:40.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些年 他揭露了许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the years, he's uncovered a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.21,0:29:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不为人知的恐怖事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unsavory stories about terror
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.17,0:29:45.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为此 得罪了某些西方国家政府...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that have upset certain Western governments and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 你好 - 在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, how are you? - Right over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.74,0:30:11.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 先生 您想点些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir. Can I take your order? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.17,0:30:19.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来个煎蛋 奶酪加胡椒粉 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the Heart-Healthy omelet with goat cheese and peppers, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.11,0:30:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 您想要些什么 女士? - 咖啡 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything for you, ma'am? - Just coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:22.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要咖啡? 我买单哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure? I'm buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.31,0:30:23.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:29.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,局长打来电话 他建议让你加入行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when the Director called and it was suggested that we bring you on...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.35,0:30:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,建议? 真的只是建议而已吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suggested? You sure it was just a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.47,0:30:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's funny how different things look
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:44.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同一件事因所处位置不同 表述的不同 效果也不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depending on where you sit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:47.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来 这对你是个帮助 帕梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look at this as a favor for you, Pam,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.07,0:30:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你个机会完成你未完成的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving you an opportunity to complete some unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.41,0:30:51.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.94,0:30:55.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩 他在这里 他是个威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne. He's here. He's a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.85,0:30:57.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们 要的是同样的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we both want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.92,0:31:00.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我们获得的手段相去甚远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we both go about it in two very different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.55,0:31:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过去的就让它过去吧 帕梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The past is past, Pam. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:05.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯德哥尔摩的事 我们太大意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were careless in Stockholm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.59,0:31:07.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么滑铁卢站这次 也是大意吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what was Waterloo? Just careless again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:10.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人泄密 这是非常严重的国家安全问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a leak. A serious national security situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.76,0:31:13.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩在我们的监视下现身 我们几乎没有时间考虑如何应对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne showed up on our surveillance and we had very little time to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.70,0:31:16.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个记者被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a reporter got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.07,0:31:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩知道我们会行动 关键是 他来这里做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne saw us coming. The question is what was he doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.07,0:31:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 关键是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the real question is how you managed
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.57,0:31:23.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以让杀手在公共车站射击?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get into a firefight at a public train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.14,0:31:26.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我都知道 危急状态下 不得不作出欠周全的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know as well as I do decisions made in real time are never perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.31,0:31:30.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用不着事后诸葛亮 你这是站着说话不腰疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't second-guess an operation from an armchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.52,0:31:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,办公室见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好享用你的蛋白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy your egg whites.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:00.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:03.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是帕梅拉·兰蒂 和她的助手汤姆·克罗宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Pamela Landy and her associate, Tom Cronin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.72,0:32:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她将领导这次的搜寻行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna be quarterbacking the search effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.12,0:32:07.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报上你们的名字和职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say your names. State your specs, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.69,0:32:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿再报名字吧 伯恩的上一个现身地点是哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's do names later, okay? What's Bourne's last fixed position?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.82,0:32:13.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伦敦 12:00\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London, 1200 Zulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.36,0:32:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,状态? 有携带武器吗? 受伤否?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status. What is he? Armed? Wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.46,0:32:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活着 机动 未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alive, mobile and unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.26,0:32:19.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 申请跨国追踪了吗? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do we have an ECHELON package? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.83,0:32:21.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么还未启动? - 我们在等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why isn't it on? - We were waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.97,0:32:24.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等待? 还等什么? 什么... 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting? For what? What... Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:27.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道自己面对的是什么人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people, do you have any idea who you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.41,0:32:28.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.64,0:32:32.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是你们追踪过的最难对付的人 而你们已经落后了9小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are nine hours behind the toughest target you have ever tracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:36.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要求每个人用上所有注意力 投入百分百精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I want everyone to sit down, strap in and turn on all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:39.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在立即行动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would mean now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.65,0:32:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.15,0:32:42.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一支队伍 负责筹划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a team deployment plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.65,0:32:45.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将罗斯的所有资料放到一号屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want everything you got on Ross on screen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:09.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 找到了点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I think we have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:11.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们截获了罗斯在《卫报》的电邮帐号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just hacked Ross' e-mail account at the Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.88,0:33:14.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发现昨天前往意大利都灵的来回机票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found a round-trip ticket to Turin, Italy, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:17.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,08:00到达 12:00起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}0800 arrival, 1205 departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:20.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们本可以确定 伯恩不是他的线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can be pretty certain that Bourne's not your source, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:24.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯刚下都灵飞回伦敦的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross's call to his editor where he said he'd just met the source
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:27.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就打电话给他的编辑 说他刚见过他的线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}took place just after his Turin flight landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.70,0:33:29.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说明他在都灵跟线人会了面 - 那么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He met his source in Turin. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.94,0:33:32.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 难道伯恩和罗斯先在都灵共进早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? So, what? Bourne met Ross in Turin for breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:35.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后又在同一天约在滑铁卢车站会面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then at noon the same day Bourne calls Ross to demand a meet at Waterloo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.91,0:33:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定他们还乘坐同一班飞机呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they were even on the same flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.41,0:33:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看都有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,核对所有CIA内部登记的手机使用情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross-check the secure cell phone usage of everyone with SCI clearance
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.15,0:33:46.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追查罗斯在都灵的时间内 所有打入和打出的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against all calls going in and out of Turin, Italy, the morning Ross was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.35,0:33:49.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要找的人是CIA特工 他掌握了高度机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy you're after is a CIA operative with clearance above top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:52.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他与罗斯的谈话是叛国行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's committing treason by talking to Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.76,0:33:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他既然知道我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think while doing that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.86,0:33:55.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以追踪到他的手机 还会用手机联络吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gonna use a cell phone that he knows we can track?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未能查到任何记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero results on the cross-check.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.80,0:33:59.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你有什么高见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you got any better ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:01.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查询罗斯在都灵整个期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, look at all the people whose cell phones were switched off
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.83,0:34:03.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有关闭手机的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the entire period Ross was in Turin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.57,0:34:05.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果大家都像我一样经常打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if your people are on their phones as much as mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.44,0:34:07.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么关机的人数应该不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the list should be pretty small.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:16.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三个人: 汤姆·布鲁斯特 杰克·布林以及尼尔·丹尼而斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three names. Tom Brewster, Jack Boulin and Neal Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.15,0:34:18.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查询罗斯住处所有与这三个人有关的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now check everything in Ross' apartment against those names.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.05,0:34:20.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check for common patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.79,0:34:23.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找任何罗斯与人会面的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look for anything that indicates who Ross met.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:25.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放大他的单子 放大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up his socials. Pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.66,0:34:27.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到文件了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See those documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.70,0:34:34.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里 名字开头字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Right there. Initials.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.47,0:34:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放大 放到大屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull that up. Bring that up on main.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔·丹尼尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neal Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.77,0:34:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是我们在马德里分站的头子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's station chief in Madrid, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:45.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.82,0:34:51.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通知大使馆的安全官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, call the RSO at the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.75,0:34:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果丹尼尔斯在那里 收押他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have them take Daniels into custody, if he is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:57.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安娜 派人到卡里诺特街的藏身处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna, get grab teams to the Calle Norte safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.12,0:34:59.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们全副武装 告诉他们我们会帮忙封锁所有入口的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send them in heavy. Tell them we'll assist with the entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.73,0:35:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全副武装? 丹尼尔斯不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy? Daniels isn't really that much of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心的是伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm worried about Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:04.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他不是线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he is not the source,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:07.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他就是在追踪这个线人 与我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then he is after the source, the same as we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:42.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二队什么时候到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ETA, Team Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.73,0:35:44.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 3分钟后抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes to destination, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.03,0:36:12.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将拯救美国人民的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mission will save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.47,0:36:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,献身这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really give yourself to this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:23.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:04.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 他们已经到达正门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, they're at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:24.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 5秒钟 - 实时监控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five seconds. - Put it up live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.11,0:37:34.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.02,0:37:39.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,防盗铃被毁坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The alarm's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.49,0:37:41.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gotta be Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.43,0:37:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 保险箱空了 - 靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The safe is empty. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.14,0:37:58.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,貌似他匆忙离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.00,0:38:00.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,监控丹尼尔斯的护照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track Daniels' passports.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:01.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈蒙德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.73,0:39:01.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的! 派后援部队!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it! Get a backup team in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.11,0:39:16.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我派上后卫队 立即派上另一队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me a secure line in there. Get the second team over there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.32,0:39:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.76,0:39:32.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柏林行动之后 我就被派到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was posted here after Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.30,0:39:36.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.40,0:39:40.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.63,0:40:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.70,0:40:06.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.00,0:40:09.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是妮基·帕森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Nicky Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.67,0:40:13.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是"踩石"计划的后勤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was Treadstone. Logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.71,0:40:16.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在柏林追捕伯恩时 她也在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was with us when we hunted Bourne in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.05,0:40:23.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮基 我需要进行身份核对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky, I need to do an ID challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.35,0:40:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,密码是麻雀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code in, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.15,0:40:29.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(危险回应: 红宝石)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.29,0:40:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回应是珠穆朗玛峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Response, Everest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.49,0:40:38.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(正常回应: 珠穆朗玛峰)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮基 我是诺亚·沃森 你到现场多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky, this is Noah Vosen. How long have you been on-site?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.70,0:40:47.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:52.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在现场有我们两名同伴 你看到他们了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have two officers on-site. Are you in contact with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.51,0:40:58.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们被放倒了 不省人事 不过还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're down. Unconscious but alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.02,0:41:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见到尼尔·丹尼尔斯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any sign of Neal Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.86,0:41:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.59,0:41:08.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮基 我是帕梅·兰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky, this is Pam Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:11.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有理由相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reason to believe there's a connection between
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.60,0:41:13.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔·丹尼尔斯与杰森·伯恩有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neal Daniels and Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.57,0:41:19.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩? 你仍在找伯恩? 我以为那个行动已经终结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne? You're still looking for Bourne? I thought that case was closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:22.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 有人坚信他仍然是个威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, some people are convinced he's still a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.54,0:41:25.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不这么认为 不过我必须与他谈谈 才能知道真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I disagree, but to find out I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:26.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 妮基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.41,0:41:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这是在干什么? - 我想给他传达一个信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you doing? - I'm trying to send him a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.58,0:41:32.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为伯恩不是威胁? 他刚又放倒两个我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think Bourne is a threat? He just took out two more of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.02,0:41:34.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一妥善解决这件事的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way this has a happy ending, Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.69,0:41:35.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是把他活捉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is if we bring him in alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:37.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在追踪丹尼尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is going after Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:39.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想复仇 帕梅 结束这一切的唯一办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants revenge, Pam, and the only realistic way
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.79,0:41:41.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是解除威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to end this is to eliminate the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.89,0:41:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后援什么时候能到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long until backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:47.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮基 请你留在原地 保护现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky, I need you to stay put and secure the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:51.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后援将在一小时之后到达 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backup will be arriving in approximately one hour. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.71,0:41:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.01,0:42:02.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有多长时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:03.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,3分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.02,0:42:07.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的车在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My car's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.22,0:42:11.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道丹尼尔斯在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where Daniels is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.90,0:42:27.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是卡里诺特街334号 刚听到抢响 有人喊叫 应该是美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.04,0:42:31.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:33.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2分钟后抵达 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes to destination, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逮捕队A组和B组...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab Teams A and B...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.45,0:42:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was Daniels headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.65,0:42:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今早8点 他电汇了100 000美元 到丹吉尔的一个银行帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 8:00 this morning, he wired $100,000 to a bank account in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离这里300英里 如果加快速度 我们能赶得上早班轮船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, that's 300 miles away. If we hurry, we can make the morning ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.79,0:42:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的车停在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you parked?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.86,0:42:51.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,右边 离北街20米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the right, 20 meters, north side of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.77,0:42:57.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.94,0:42:59.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.31,0:43:02.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个目标从藏身处出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two subjects seen exiting safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.99,0:43:16.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.79,0:43:18.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:27.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.37,0:43:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标行踪丢失 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost visual contact with the subjects, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.10,0:43:30.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.67,0:43:36.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下达指示 对伯恩格杀勿论 即刻生效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Issue a standing kill order on Jason Bourne, effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.04,0:43:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,联系西班牙方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send out a system one alert to all Spanish contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.38,0:43:44.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进行全面封锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all air and ground border exits locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.94,0:44:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.31,0:44:11.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯手上到底有什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Daniels got?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.71,0:44:14.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"黑荆棘"计划又是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Operation Blackbriar?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.92,0:44:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己告诉我 还是我打电话问克雷莫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to tell me, or should I call Kramer and ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.42,0:44:26.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天哪 帕梅 这可是在行动中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Christ's sake, Pam, we're in the middle of an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.59,0:44:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.13,0:44:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要杰森·伯恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want Jason Bourne,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.06,0:44:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.61,0:44:45.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"黑荆棘"计划一开始是监视计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Blackbriar started as an NEAT surveillance program.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.51,0:44:46.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.78,0:44:50.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在它是作为保护伞 掩护我们所有幕后行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is now the umbrella program for all our black ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.18,0:44:53.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括侵入 押送 试验性审问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full envelope intrusion, rendition, experimental interrogation
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.02,0:44:56.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全部由这个办公室发出指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is all run out of this office.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是金字塔的顶端 帕梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the sharp end of the stick now, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.46,0:45:02.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括杀害行动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lethal action?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.96,0:45:05.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在必要的时候 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we have to, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正因如此 我们才特别 无需许可证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what makes us special. No more red tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.47,0:45:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再不用为了等华盛顿签署命令 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more getting the bad guys caught in our sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.64,0:45:14.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睁睁看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then watching them escape
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.97,0:45:17.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坏蛋从眼前逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while we wait for someone in Washington to issue the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.64,0:45:20.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.81,0:45:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅 你大场面见过不少 你知道他们有多么危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen the raw intel, Pam. You know how real the danger is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.45,0:45:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要这样的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need these programs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.05,0:45:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯跟这个有什么关系?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the connection to Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.09,0:45:33.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在南欧以及北非的所有行动都由他负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ran all of our operations in Southern Europe and North Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.86,0:45:35.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他掌握着所有资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so he has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:39.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,名字 日期 我们在海外的联系人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names, dates, ghost sites, who's cooperating with us abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.07,0:45:43.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让这些落入伯恩手中 然后流入市场吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want that stuff in Bourne's hands, out on the market to the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.97,0:45:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.54,0:45:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩不是为了钱 他为了某个原因要找丹尼尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's not after money. He's after Daniels for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.01,0:45:54.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 管他伯恩想找什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what does it matter what Bourne is after?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.68,0:45:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 只要找到丹尼尔斯 我们就能找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we find Daniels, and, believe me, we'll find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.15,0:45:59.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.52,0:46:02.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩也会在我们手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we get Bourne, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.08,0:46:32.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.22,0:46:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要找丹尼尔斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you looking for Daniels?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.23,0:46:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这个是谁吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.67,0:46:52.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是丹尼尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.14,0:46:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道另外一个是谁 他是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who that is. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.38,0:47:04.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一开始就在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was there at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.75,0:47:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得自己见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.25,0:47:11.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.92,0:47:13.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯带我去见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels brought me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.66,0:47:18.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是从那里开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where it all started for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我身上发生了一些事 我需要知道是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something happened to me and I need to know what it was
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.70,0:47:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我永远无法摆脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I'll never be free of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.04,0:47:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯说 对你的训练是试验性质的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daniels said the training was experimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.75,0:47:36.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行为修正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behavior modification.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:41.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须先让特工瓦解 然后他们才能负责行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had to break down the agents before they became operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.15,0:47:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说你是第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you were the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.59,0:47:50.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.41,0:48:03.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与你在一起 对我来说 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was difficult for me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.08,0:48:06.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的什么也不记得了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.73,0:48:29.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.48,0:48:40.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(尼尔·丹尼尔斯护照追踪 锁定)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.75,0:48:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 威尔逊先生 你应该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir? Mr. Wills? You're gonna want to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:05.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在丹吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.41,0:49:13.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.25,0:49:25.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到丹尼尔斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have found Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.73,0:49:32.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们查到了他在丹吉尔的一个旅馆里 用了他的护照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've just tracked Daniels' passport to a hotel in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.63,0:49:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们借故拖延丹尼尔斯的银行转帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're holding up a bank transfer he made to keep him in place
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.60,0:49:37.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时从卡萨布兰卡派出了杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while they bring an asset up from Casablanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.37,0:49:38.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.18,0:49:48.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.25,0:49:50.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉·兰蒂 她说有紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Pam Landy. She says it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.08,0:49:53.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她我没空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her I'm unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.58,0:49:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.58,0:50:29.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(摩洛哥 丹吉尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.31,0:50:51.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 杀手已经到达机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, asset has arrived at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.86,0:51:16.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我目标位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the subject's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.40,0:51:19.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标徒步 正进入莫拉博斯旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject is now on foot and entering Hotel Velasquez.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.74,0:51:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,旅馆距离银行2.2公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hotel is 2.2 kilometers from the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.64,0:51:26.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给出旅馆正面图 平面图 一间间找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get an elevation and a floor plan, tic-tac-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.91,0:51:28.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找出房间位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locate the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉杀手房间位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the asset subject location
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及旅馆到银行的路线图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the route between the subject's hotel and the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,房间位置确定了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have that room yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.37,0:51:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 长官 117号房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. It's room 117.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.20,0:51:54.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,掌握旅馆总线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get a hold of the hotel trunk line.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.64,0:51:58.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,监控旅馆117号房间.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run all calls through here with an ISO on room 117.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.86,0:52:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的位置被防火墙阻挡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His location's being blocked by the firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.19,0:52:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们已经找到丹尼尔斯了 也知道他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they found Daniels. They know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.69,0:52:18.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们派出杀手去解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll get one of the operatives to terminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.60,0:52:20.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把杀手找出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.97,0:52:25.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴仕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他你要见他 说你要给他一部新手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him you're gonna meet him and you have a new phone for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.94,0:52:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你阻止了戴仕 他们也会找别人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you stop Desh, they'll just get someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.18,0:52:35.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是要阻止他 而是要跟踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're not gonna stop him, we're gonna follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.25,0:52:36.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会带领我们找到丹尼尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll take us right to Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.72,0:53:17.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 杀手背离了预定路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the asset is deviating off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.86,0:53:21.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it play.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.66,0:53:55.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀手意外停止行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asset unscheduled stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.26,0:54:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 杀手正在向目标移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, asset is on the move en route to subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.19,0:54:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 有人未经授权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we have an unauthorized breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.43,0:54:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,侵入我们的网络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone with active system knowledge penetrated our protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:38.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在当地时间14:11向杀手发送指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instructions were sent to the asset at 1411 local time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:40.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指令是有效的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trace is confirmed and valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.40,0:54:43.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是通过妮基·帕森注册的计算机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came from a computer belonging to Nicky Parsons.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.28,0:54:49.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,背离发生在哪个地点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did the course deviation occur?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.21,0:54:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贝尔基路南面 过了佛郎路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South to Rue de Belgique, stationary Place de France.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.98,0:54:55.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕森就在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where Parsons is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.12,0:54:57.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解决丹尼尔斯之后 让杀手解决妮可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we're finished with Daniels, send the asset after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:54:58.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.49,0:55:00.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到帕森 找到伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find Parsons, we find Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.79,0:55:02.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 你这是干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.19,0:55:04.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在不是时候 - 我需要知道 到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not now. - I wanna know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.86,0:55:06.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了现在不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你依据什么发布这个指令?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What basis are you continuing this operation on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.67,0:55:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的依据就是 妮基已经危及我们的隐蔽行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the basis that Nicky Parsons has compromised a covert operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.57,0:55:12.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她把我们置于不利境地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is up to her neck in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个行动是针对丹尼尔斯的 不是妮基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is about Daniels, not Nicky!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.84,0:55:17.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道情况 诺亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know the circumstances, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.51,0:55:19.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 她现在跟伯恩一条战线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in league with Jason Bourne, for Christ's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.38,0:55:22.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无权杀死她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not have the authority to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.31,0:55:25.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我有权 你最好识点时务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, I do. And you had better get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:27.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚 她是我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah, she's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.52,0:55:30.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一旦走出这一步 将要如何收场?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You start down this path, where does it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.12,0:55:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们获胜的时候就是收场的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ends when we've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.50,0:55:49.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解决丹尼尔斯之后 让杀手干掉他俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we're finished with Daniels, send the asset after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.51,0:55:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.74,0:55:52.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了 快点 - 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, come on. - Stand by...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.26,0:56:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2分钟 长官 2分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes, sir. Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.77,0:56:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉银行解除电汇冻结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the bank to release the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.82,0:56:33.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.12,0:56:36.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钱已经到户
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.16,0:56:43.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.87,0:57:22.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:24.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,200米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:26.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我应该多准备点跟踪摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, come on, I want to lay in some preliminary tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.31,0:57:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.42,1:09:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发密信 就说我们死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code it in. We need to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.56,1:09:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 杀手证实两个目标都已经被消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir? Asset confirms both targets are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.01,1:09:44.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活要见人 死要见尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.61,1:09:46.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让拉巴特的站长确认死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask the station chief from Rabat to confirm the deaths
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:48.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,秘密搜寻尸首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and do a sub-rosa collection of the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.58,1:09:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要求这件事万无一失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to tie this thing off completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.65,1:09:52.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心监视兰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep an eye on Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.93,1:10:03.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.03,1:10:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩和妮基·帕森都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne and Nicky Parsons are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.27,1:10:07.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.67,1:10:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉巴特的站长正在核实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our station chief in Rabat is confirming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.98,1:10:14.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能让我暴露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't afford to have this come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.41,1:10:17.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 你是受保护的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. You're protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.08,1:10:20.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定记住我们派兰蒂到你那里的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember why we put Landy there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.82,1:10:23.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果"黑荆棘"计划泄露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Blackbriar goes south,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就卷铺盖走人重新来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll roll it up, hang it around her neck and start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.29,1:11:37.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能看到他们的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see their faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:45.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀过的每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone I ever killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.74,1:11:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是不知道他们的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't know their names.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.72,1:12:07.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽过去常常...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie used to try to
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.26,1:12:12.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...帮助我回忆他们的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}help me remember the names.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.42,1:12:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(任务中止)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.32,1:12:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(目标: 尼瓦纳·瓦博斯； 国籍: 尼日利亚)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.92,1:12:22.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(执行人: 杰森·伯恩 | "踩石计划"结果: 失败)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:27.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想为我做过的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tried to apologize for...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.15,1:12:29.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做过的一切道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为我现在做的事情道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.12,1:12:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的心依然沉重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of it makes it any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.61,1:12:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会继续追杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna come for you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.05,1:13:06.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须马上逃亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to run now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.20,1:13:31.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,("踩石"计划  杰森·伯恩)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.29,1:13:34.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(实验对象表现出反抗迹象)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.88,1:13:38.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(阿尔伯特·赫斯医生授权)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.71,1:13:45.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(阿尔伯特·赫斯医生   职位: 首席医务官)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.72,1:13:52.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(对象在99年6月1日被送到纽约 东71街415号"踩石"特别治疗部门)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.14,1:13:57.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(特别研究部指导训练官 尼尔·丹尼尔斯记录)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.20,1:14:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.56,1:15:02.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gets easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.59,1:15:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼尔斯先生的东西都在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.60,1:15:23.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.89,1:15:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.02,1:15:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开看看
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.12,1:15:45.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(中央情报局 纽约40街105号)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.29,1:15:52.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约)
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.13,1:16:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,情报站站长奥玛巴刚打电话过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Station chief in Rabat just called.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.70,1:16:08.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们找到了尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found a body.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.90,1:16:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伯恩? - 戴仕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bourne? - Desh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.78,1:16:21.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅 你应该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pam. You need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.42,1:16:32.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个叫吉尔波特·皮安特的人 刚入境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A passport for Gilberto de Piento just cleared immigration.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.36,1:16:35.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是"踩石"计划中 杰森·伯恩的化名之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an early Treadstone identity registered to Jason Bourne,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.83,1:16:38.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从来没有使用过这个化名 这个化名也从来没有浮现过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he never used it, and it never went to the grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.00,1:16:40.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.17,1:16:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.27,1:16:52.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果知道 他们现在就不会呆在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if they knew, Vosen wouldn't be in his office right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.34,1:16:53.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真是冒了极大风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a hell of a risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.11,1:16:57.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许伯恩就是想让我们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Bourne wants us to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.65,1:17:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像上次在那不勒斯一样 也许他在和我们联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like Naples. Maybe he's communicating.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.22,1:17:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他在联系你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's trying to communicate with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.32,1:17:06.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们应该回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we should communicate back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.66,1:17:09.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道伯恩在寻找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know what Bourne's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.07,1:17:20.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉尔波特·皮安特 吉尔波特·皮安特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gilberto de Piento. Gilberto de Piento.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.00,1:17:23.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的伙伴在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your party is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.67,1:18:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.23,1:18:59.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你还在找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you're still looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.64,1:19:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.87,1:19:05.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.08,1:19:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.18,1:19:12.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好过来 我们发现了新情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better get in here. We got a situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.28,1:19:14.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.02,1:19:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想...谢谢你提供的录音带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to thank you for the tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.02,1:19:23.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情已经全部解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all tied off. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.16,1:19:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该对你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.70,1:19:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是官方的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that official?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.57,1:19:31.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 非官方的 你知道原委的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Off the record. You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.50,1:19:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪结果?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tracing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.57,1:19:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还要50秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty seconds to trace.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.14,1:19:36.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodbye. - Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.88,1:19:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·韦伯 是你的真名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David Webb. That's your real name.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.31,1:19:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你生于71年4月15日的 密苏里州尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were born 4/15/71 in Nixa, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.92,1:19:50.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不过来 我们好好谈谈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come in and we'll talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.82,1:19:54.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里面绝对有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is very wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.36,1:19:57.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.73,1:20:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好休息一下 帕梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some rest, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.26,1:20:02.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很疲倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.17,1:20:07.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在看着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's looking right at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.24,1:20:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.41,1:20:13.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是国家安全的紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a national security emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.38,1:20:15.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们即将受到严重威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an imminent threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.41,1:20:17.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.15,1:20:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现身 他就会找到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I show myself, he'll find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.58,1:20:22.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森·伯恩还活着 就在纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason Bourne is alive and is at large in New York City,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.52,1:20:24.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信就在我们周围方圆1000码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, we believe, within 1,000 yards of this building.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.99,1:20:27.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要求马上封闭周围12个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want an immediate 12-block lockdown of the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.72,1:20:29.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上通知兰利总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a flash message to Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.36,1:20:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动本地后备系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prep for local backup assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.83,1:20:35.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,兰蒂刚离开大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Landy just left the building!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.33,1:20:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,窃听她的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with her phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.68,1:20:56.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她正在用手机收短信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's using her cell. There's an incoming text.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.89,1:20:58.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要短信内容 - 正在获取 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get it. - Working on it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.19,1:20:59.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几个人跟踪兰蒂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many do we have on Landy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.36,1:21:00.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,6个 还有后援正在到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six men. More on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.59,1:21:03.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我收到了 先生 现在就显示到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it, sir! Coming up on the screen now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.30,1:21:07.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(都铎城路和42街 10分钟后 单独见面)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.56,1:21:10.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟踪兰蒂的所有人 马上去都铎城路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody not on Landy goes directly to Tudor City.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.90,1:21:13.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备车辆 我们上车指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the vehicles. We're going mobile.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.17,1:21:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 第二组 第二组 - 所有小组集合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Team Two. Team Two. - All teams, call in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,178号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}178th.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.65,1:22:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个死胡同 他为什么要这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way out of there. Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.45,1:22:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在困住自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trapping himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.82,1:22:03.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是一个会面的好地点 太显眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bad place to meet. It's too exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.65,1:22:05.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他选这个地方一定有他的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't have chosen it if he didn't have a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.60,1:22:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标还在行进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject is en route.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.76,1:22:15.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,屋顶43 看到目标通知我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roof 43, let me know when you have visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.77,1:22:17.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,屋顶43 随时待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roof 43, standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.27,1:22:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.38,1:22:28.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们现在行动 覆盖周围200米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, folks, here we go. Box 200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.81,1:22:30.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visual on leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.21,1:22:32.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地面43号就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}43 ground in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.02,1:22:35.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一看到兰蒂 马上通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as you have eyes on Landy, I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.30,1:22:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 她来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.53,1:22:53.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 我也看到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. I see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.45,1:23:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有伯恩的迹象吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any sign of Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.48,1:23:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.82,1:23:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of target.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.90,1:23:24.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.37,1:23:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.17,1:23:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还在想你什么时候能给我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering when you were going to make this call.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.94,1:23:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么得到这个号码的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.58,1:23:36.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真以为我去都铎城路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't actually think I was coming to Tudor City, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.45,1:23:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.05,1:23:41.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你想跟我谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it's me you want to talk to,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.99,1:23:44.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以安排一个会面地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perhaps we can arrange a meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.52,1:23:46.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.16,1:23:49.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在我的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting in my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.59,1:23:52.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.63,1:23:54.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不信?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would you doubt that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.53,1:23:55.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你现在就在办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were in your office right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.00,1:23:59.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们就是在面对面谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd be having this conversation face to face.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.08,1:24:07.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚·沃森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.51,1:24:12.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,密码10取消行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a code ten abort.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.32,1:24:14.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人回到车上 密码10取消行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want everyone back in the vehicles. This is a code ten abort.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.85,1:24:16.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走! 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.25,1:24:21.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(绝密: 黑荆棘计划)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.56,1:24:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,("踩石"计划升级到"黑荆棘"计划)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.84,1:24:28.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(被杀 机密: 美国公民)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.11,1:24:40.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.24,1:24:41.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔森 马上检查我的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wills, check my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:47.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.35,1:24:48.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.99,1:24:54.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让保安到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need building security up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.73,1:24:57.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他拿走了全部档案 - 妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's got everything. - God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.66,1:24:59.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁大楼周围4个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, set a four-block perimeter around the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.83,1:25:01.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody give me a visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.20,1:25:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要求整座大楼都被搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the entire building searched.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.67,1:25:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每个房间 每个走廊 每个壁橱 每个通风道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every room, every hallway, every closet, every goddamn air duct.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.07,1:25:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗? 我要你们找到他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand? I want him found!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.71,1:25:12.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.04,1:25:16.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩进入大楼 打开了沃森的保险柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne just broke into CRI. He got into Vosen's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.52,1:25:19.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.78,1:25:22.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,东71街415号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}415 East 71st Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.95,1:25:25.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,71街415号? 天啊 帕梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four-fifteen-seventy-one? Jesus, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.55,1:25:53.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target in sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.99,1:25:59.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标向北转入第8大道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North on Eighth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.63,1:26:08.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目标进入港务局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's headed east in the Port Authority.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.20,1:26:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,授权所有特工 可以格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All agents have shoot-on-sight authorization.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.92,1:26:36.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.17,1:27:20.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 他开下房顶了 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, he drove off the roof. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.67,1:27:22.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他开下房顶了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drove off the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.01,1:27:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他下车了 现在在跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on foot. He's running.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.79,1:27:38.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察! 不许动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.09,1:27:39.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.47,1:27:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫后援!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call for backup!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.63,1:28:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你看 伯恩的生日 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, sir, take a look at this! Bourne's birthday, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.43,1:28:19.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么问题? - 请看 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about it? - Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.83,1:28:24.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,兰蒂告诉伯恩他的生日是71年4月15号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Landy told Bourne that his birthday was 4l15l71.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.93,1:28:26.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉他的是一个密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. It's a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.54,1:28:30.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都停下手头的工作! 听着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything stops. Everything stops! Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.24,1:28:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,4/15/71 新的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4l15l71. New assignment, numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.14,1:28:35.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这组数字是什么意思? 快解码!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it mean? Give me encryption codes!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.08,1:28:37.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 转换成经纬度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, if you plug them in as variables of longitude and latitude
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.71,1:28:39.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是喀麦隆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you get Cameroon.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.55,1:28:42.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,41571是肯塔基州瓦尔尼的邮政编码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}41571 is the zip code for Varney, Kentucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.42,1:28:46.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她给的是什么数字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What date did she give him?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.69,1:28:49.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,4/15/71\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4/15/71.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.39,1:28:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.69,1:28:55.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这组号码表示东71街415号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SRD is at 415 East 71st Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.43,1:28:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉了他训练中心的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just gave him the training facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.23,1:28:58.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.43,1:29:00.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有小组跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring all the teams in behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.32,1:31:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 报警!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up! Somebody call 911!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.09,1:31:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救救他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.46,1:31:39.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 特工没有杀掉伯恩 我们也跟丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The asset lost Bourne. We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.17,1:31:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔伯特 我是沃森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Albert, it's Vosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.54,1:31:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩知道了一切 他正在去你那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne knows everything and he's on his way to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.78,1:31:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming home, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.08,1:31:58.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有多长时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long do I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.98,1:32:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.28,1:32:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你赶快跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.72,1:32:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm gonna stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.75,1:32:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会来训练中心一侧 那是他以前待过的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll head for the training wing. That's what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.56,1:32:12.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会稳住他 直到你赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep him in play till you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.58,1:33:05.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给了我这些 他们会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll kill you for giving me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.68,1:33:08.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,4/15/71也不算密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4l15l71 isn't much of a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.65,1:33:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜沃森已经赶过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guess is Vosen is on his way already.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.36,1:33:14.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.26,1:33:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那不是我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this isn't what I signed up for,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.46,1:33:18.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对你做了这些  "黑荆棘"计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what they did to you, Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.20,1:33:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.73,1:33:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你就做点什么吧 你需要的都在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then do something about it. Everything you need is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.71,1:33:32.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.48,1:33:36.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维 何不和我一起进去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David. Why don't you come in with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.81,1:33:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起去会更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be better if we do this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.38,1:33:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.68,1:33:43.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是我开始的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where it started for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.35,1:33:46.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是结束的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.37,1:34:00.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是兰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.18,1:34:10.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曼迪·艾伦 请拨分机200\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mandy Aaron, dial extension 200, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.08,1:34:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曼迪·艾伦 拨分机200\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mandy Aaron, dial extension 200.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.28,1:34:14.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁这座大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, lock this building down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.82,1:34:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,周围1个街区警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set a secure perimeter of one block.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.66,1:34:27.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我是帕梅拉·兰蒂 我要发送机密文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. This is Pamela Landy. I have to send a classified document.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派一个小组去追伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a team to SRD after Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.10,1:34:30.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人派到这个医院的所有公共区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And put someone in every public area of this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.97,1:34:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电梯间 员工电梯 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Elevator shafts, service entrances, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.31,1:34:41.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼! 南边的电梯 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it! South bay! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.45,1:34:44.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 这是紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this is a priority one situation!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.38,1:34:45.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要求你们的完全合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will give us your full cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.85,1:34:48.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看过去3分钟大厦的 全部监视录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me playback for the entire building for the last three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.08,1:34:49.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.90,1:35:02.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.00,1:35:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个! 这是哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one, here! Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.17,1:35:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.37,1:35:13.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己去抓兰蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take Landy on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.81,1:35:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好找个好律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get yourself a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.39,1:36:08.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,剃刀边缘有个共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A republic lives on the knife's edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.57,1:36:20.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完成后 你就不再是戴维·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we are finished with you, you will no longer be David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.01,1:36:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至记不得那个名字是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may not even remember who he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.45,1:36:31.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么我们这么对待你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why we're treating you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.19,1:36:34.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.43,1:36:40.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你是遇到了一些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you've been having some problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.73,1:36:42.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.47,1:36:46.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不想谈的话就不会到这来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be here if I didn't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.67,1:36:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我过去三年一直在逃亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent three years running.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.71,1:36:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三年来一直想知道自己是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three years trying to find out who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.98,1:36:58.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是记不起来 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've still not got it all back, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.58,1:37:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,破碎的记忆难以拼凑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still not filled in the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.98,1:37:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.72,1:37:07.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有武器 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm unarmed, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.02,1:37:10.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是我? 你为什么要选我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why me? Why did you pick me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.93,1:37:14.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的记不起来 是不是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your really don't remember, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.93,1:37:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们选择你 而是你选择了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't pick you. You picked us.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.07,1:37:24.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是自愿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.64,1:37:28.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.08,1:37:32.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使我们已经警告了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even after you were warned.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.69,1:37:44.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,韦伯上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.59,1:37:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.43,1:37:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来到这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.54,1:37:58.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛都没眨 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't even blink, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.48,1:38:05.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把这个递给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just handed me these.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.71,1:38:12.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(戴维·韦伯)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.35,1:38:14.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事情都对你解释了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has everything been explained to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.69,1:38:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.63,1:38:22.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想报效国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you wanted to serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.63,1:38:27.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的任务会拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your missions will save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.74,1:38:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.24,1:38:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过我会拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said I'd be saving American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.41,1:38:37.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确实是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.18,1:38:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在替你杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was killing for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:42.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,替他们杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.85,1:38:48.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你完全知道你选择留下 意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew exactly what it meant for you if you chose to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.79,1:38:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完成后 你就不再是戴维·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we are finished with you, you will no longer be David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.10,1:38:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我成为谁 我就成为谁 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be whoever you need me to be, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.23,1:38:59.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能逃避你做过的事 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't outrun what you did, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.50,1:39:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让自己成为了后来的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made yourself into who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.94,1:39:06.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最终你必须面对现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually you're gonna have to face the fact
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.98,1:39:11.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你在这里选择成为了杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you chose right here to become Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.09,1:39:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很久没有睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't slept for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.93,1:39:28.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你决定了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you made a decision?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.60,1:39:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样没法继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.04,1:39:36.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须现在决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.41,1:39:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.14,1:39:43.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经讨论过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been through that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.42,1:39:49.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.59,1:39:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.27,1:40:07.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.94,1:40:11.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是自愿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.74,1:40:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd do anything it takes to
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.58,1:40:18.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来拯救美国公民的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}save American lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.38,1:40:21.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在说谎 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a liar, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.55,1:40:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者太软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or too weak
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.92,1:40:27.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能胜任?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see this through?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.43,1:40:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.09,1:40:34.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忘掉戴维·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.60,1:40:44.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,献身这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really give yourself to this program.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.60,1:41:11.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no longer
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.43,1:41:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,戴维·韦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.27,1:41:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起 你就是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, you'll be known as Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.18,1:41:23.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎加入这个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.53,1:41:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在记起来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.14,1:41:48.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.87,1:41:52.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记起来一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.34,1:41:56.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no longer Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.18,1:42:00.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你会杀我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now you're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.72,1:42:02.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.62,1:42:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不配挂在兰利墙上的星星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve the star they'd give you on the wall at Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.17,1:42:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他去屋顶了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's headed for the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.39,1:43:12.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么没有开枪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you take the shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.60,1:43:24.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么要杀我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know why you're supposed to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.14,1:43:35.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.55,1:43:40.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看他们让你付出的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what they make you give.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.07,1:44:33.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 参议员们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, senators.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.67,1:44:38.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请允许我先发表一个声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may, I'd like to begin by making a statement for the record.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.44,1:44:46.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,文件显示爱兹拉·克雷莫 授权6项非法的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The file indicates that Ezra Kramer authorized six illegal...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.15,1:44:47.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总统今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President convened
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.28,1:44:49.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,召开紧急内阁会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an emergency cabinet meeting today
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.15,1:44:50.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讨论越来越多的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to discuss the growing scandal
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.62,1:44:53.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,政府涉嫌暗杀行动的丑闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over an alleged government assassination program,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.46,1:44:55.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行动代号"黑荆棘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}code-named Blackbriar.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.52,1:44:58.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,CIA局长爱兹拉·克雷莫因为授权此行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CIA Director Ezra Kramer is under criminal investigation
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.76,1:45:00.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,受到司法调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for authorizing the program,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.70,1:45:04.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其中几起涉及到杀害美国公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which in several cases may have even targeted US citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.74,1:45:11.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个CIA的高级官员已被逮捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two agency officials have already been arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.51,1:45:15.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔伯特·赫斯医生 "黑荆棘"计划的策划者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Albert Hirsch, the alleged mastermind of Blackbriar program
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.34,1:45:19.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,CIA部门长官诺亚·沃森 计划实施的主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and CIA Deputy Director Noah Vosen, the program's operational chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.32,1:45:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时戴维·韦伯 或者说杰森·伯恩的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, mystery surrounds the fate of David Webb,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.99,1:45:27.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,依然是个迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}also known as Jason Bourne, the source
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.89,1:45:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是揭露"黑荆棘"计划的关键人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the exposure of the Blackbriar program.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.73,1:45:34.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据报道韦伯被击中 从曼哈顿的10楼屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been reported that Webb was shot and fell from a Manhattan rooftop
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.23,1:45:36.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坠入纽约东河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the East River ten stories below.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.03,1:45:39.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是经过三天的搜寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, after a three-day search,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.07,1:45:41.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,韦伯的尸体仍然没有被找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Webb's body has yet to be found.
